    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yerobowaamu Asinza Ennyana eza Zaabu e Beseri n'e Ddaani",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Yerobowaamu n'azimba Sekemu mu Efulayimu ensi ey'ensozi, era n'abeera eyo. Eyo gye yava n'agenda n'azimba Penieri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobowaamu ne yeerowooza munda ye nti, \"Obwakabaka sikulwa nga budda mu nnyumba ya Dawudi!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bano bwe banayambukanga okuwaayo ebiweebwayo mu yeekaalu ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Mukama",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "1KI.12.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu Yerusaalemi, olunaku olumu emitima gyabwe giyinza okukyukira mukama waabwe, Lekobowaamu, kabaka wa Yuda. Balinzita ne badda gy'ali.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awo Kabaka Yerobowaamu n'aweebwa amagezi okukola ennyana bbiri eza zaabu. N'agamba abantu nti, \"Kijja kubazitoowerera nnyo okwambukanga e Yerusaalemi. Baabano bakatonda bammwe, Ayi Isirayiri, abaabaggya mu Misiri.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emu n'agiteeka mu Beseri n'endala mu Ddaani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekintu ekyo ne kiba kibi nnyo, kubanga abantu baatuuka n'okugenda e Ddaani okusinza ekifaananyi ky'ennyana ekyali kiteekeddwa eyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerobowaamu n'azimba amasabo mu bifo ebigulumivu n'alonda bakabona",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "ng'abaggya mu bantu abaabulijjo, newaakubadde nga tebaali ba kika kya Leevi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'akola embaga ku lunaku olw'ekkumi n'ettaano mu mwezi ogw'omunaana, okufaanana n'embaga ebeerawo mu Yuda, era n'awaayo ebyokebwa ku kyoto. Kino yakikola mu Beseri ng'awaayo ssaddaaka eri ennyana ze yakola. N'assa bakabona mu bifo ebigulumivu bye yali akoze e Beseri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku lunaku olw'ekkumi n'ettaano mu mwezi ogw'omunaana gwe yeerondera, n'awaayo ebiweebwayo ebyokebwa ku kyoto kye yazimba e Beseri. Era n'assaawo embaga Abayisirayiri gye baakuumanga, n'ayambukanga ne ku kyoto okuwaayo ebyokebwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.12.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
